  <metadata>
    <id>UiPath.IntelligentOCR.Activities</id>
    <version>6.10.1-preview</version>
    <title>UiPath.IntelligentOCR.Activities</title>
    <authors>UiPath</authors>
    <owners>UiPath</owners>
    <requireLicenseAcceptance>true</requireLicenseAcceptance>
    <licenseUrl>https://www.uipath.com/hubfs/legalspot/UiPath_MSSA.pdf</licenseUrl>
    <projectUrl>https://activities.uipath.com/docs/about-the-intelligent-ocr-activities-pack</projectUrl>
    <iconUrl>https://download.uipath.com/DU_icon.png?intelligent-ocr</iconUrl>
    <description>IMPORTANT: Installing this package version requires upgrading all the other Document Understanding packages to their latest version. (in case any are installed).

This includes the following packages: IntelligentOCR (&gt;= 6.10.0), DocumentUnderstanding.ML (&gt;= 1.22.0), PDF (&gt;= 3.15.0), AmazonTextract (&gt;= 1.0.0), OCR.Activities (&gt;= 3.9.0) and OmniPage (&gt;= 1.11.0). On lower versions, some functionality may be missing or unexpected errors might occur.

Core activities that enable the usage of a complete document processing framework, from taxonomy definition, digitization, document classification, data extraction, data validation and classifier / extractor training.</description>
    <releaseNotes>https://docs.uipath.com/releasenotes/docs/uipath-intelligentocr-activities</releaseNotes>
